            "review_title": "Review at Y Thien Vegeterian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "ASBryant\nReading, United Kingdom43 contributions\n0\nTasty and super cheap\nDec 2016\nGreat locals veggie restaurant. No menu and no English spoken, but with a bit of arm waving to indicate just to bring us anything, we got a small bowl of soup and a large plate of rice and lots of different veg and fake meat. All very tasty. Total charged was 20,000 dong for two of us (roughly 70p UK!).\nWritten December 11, 2016",
