            "review_title": "Review at Y Thien Vegeterian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "aprilsfreak\nCanary Islands, Spain173 contributions\n0\nVery good food and fun owner\nApr 2016 • Solo\nI was looking for a vegetarian place in Da Nang and the clerk at the Hostel I was staying in suggested this place. It is the typical Vietnamese restaurant, NOTHING fancy, only locals but it tends to get really busy at dinner time. The food is very good (noodles and rice) and the owner is a very nice and friendly person. The second night I went there he asked me to sit with him and also tried to find a Vietnamese girlfriend for me!!! :D\nEverybody working there was very friendly, I was the only non local and they treated me like a superstar and the prices are very good!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 8, 2016",
